WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.795
Hi, welcome to MoreThanMoney.

2
00:00:01.845 --> 00:00:05.930
If you're here, it's because you feel you deserve more from life.

3
00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.614
And let me tell you: you don't need to keep forcing it.

4
00:00:08.664 --> 00:00:12.860
Your time has come: time to invest with intelligence and win more freedom for yourself.

5
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.244
My name is Ricardo.

6
00:00:13.294 --> 00:00:17.220
I was in the military from 2002 and, later, a member of the security forces.

7
00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:19.859
For years I carried out my mission with pride,

8
00:00:19.909 --> 00:00:22.900
but deep down I felt there was something more for me.

9
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.420
And then I discovered the digital world.

10
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:30.254
With it, the power to build a different path: a path that brought time, control and purpose.

11
00:00:30.304 --> 00:00:32.250
And that's how MoreThanMoney was born.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:37.500
Here we believe people are more than numbers. More than bills, invoices…

13
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.967
…and more than a salary at the end of the month.

14
00:00:40.017 --> 00:00:44.130
We believe in real growth, and that's why we built a complete system to help you.

15
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:50.700
Financial education adapted to you, real-time signals and scanners, artificial intelligence…

16
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:55.570
…working for you, a united community, direct support and exclusive tools.

17
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.515
You start by learning, and there are two pillars.

18
00:00:58.565 --> 00:01:00.819
The first is MTM Markets: markets and money.

19
00:01:00.869 --> 00:01:04.641
Academies for forex and metals, crypto, stocks and ETFs, and real estate.

20
00:01:04.691 --> 00:01:09.300
Live rooms every week, and recordings organised into a course for when you can't make it.

21
00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:16.180
The second is MTM Content and Business: building an audience and building a business.

22
00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:20.974
Social media and UGC, faceless marketing, artificial intelligence, network marketing,

23
00:01:21.024 --> 00:01:24.132
and mindset and leadership, which you can open for free.

24
00:01:24.182 --> 00:01:26.260
You start from zero, at your own pace.

25
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.440
Then you apply.

26
00:01:27.490 --> 00:01:30.462
Our scanners, Gold Killer, Aurum Flow, TrendShot and MTM Scanner,

27
00:01:30.512 --> 00:01:31.903
are studies we wrote ourselves.

28
00:01:31.953 --> 00:01:35.859
They read the market and show you the trend, the zones and the risk before you get in.

29
00:01:35.909 --> 00:01:37.792
They run on your phone and on TradingView.

30
00:01:37.842 --> 00:01:40.230
You stop guessing and start working from a checklist.

31
00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:52.595
And all of this fits in your pocket.

32
00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:55.928
The MTM System app brings together the community feed, the chat,

33
00:01:55.978 --> 00:01:57.803
the live classes, alerts with entry,

34
00:01:57.853 --> 00:02:01.155
stop and targets, and the AI Mentor, who answers you at any hour.

35
00:02:01.205 --> 00:02:04.230
You get the alert, you see the chart, and you make the call.

36
00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.038
When you decide yes, the MTM Auto app comes in.

37
00:02:08.088 --> 00:02:11.201
That's where Tap to Trade lives: one tap opens the order in your account,

38
00:02:11.251 --> 00:02:12.761
and the system manages the position.

39
00:02:12.811 --> 00:02:16.711
If you'd rather not watch charts, MTM Auto also copies the house strategies to your account.

40
00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:17.914
The account is always yours.

41
00:02:17.964 --> 00:02:19.030
We never touch your money.

42
00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:35.040
All so you can finally say: "Now, yes, life is changing." Now you have a choice.

43
00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.421
If you want to learn and master your own path,

44
00:02:37.471 --> 00:02:40.320
if you want to automate and let the systems do the work,

45
00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:47.000
or if you'd rather just be a member and use everything we've already built for you: click "See offers" and choose your path.

46
00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.145
Freedom isn't a distant dream.

47
00:02:49.195 --> 00:02:53.720
It's right in front of you. Start now. Welcome to MoreThanMoney.

